Package: pgBearerHook
Title: Integration Fixture for Existing PostgreSQL OAuth Bearer Tokens
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("shinyOAuthDB", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.invalid")
Description: Integration-only Linux fixture that temporarily supplies an
    already acquired bearer token through the libpq 18 authentication hook,
    while RPostgres continues to create and operate the DBI connection.
    This is not a production database driver or an OAuth implementation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: DBI, RPostgres
SystemRequirements: Linux, libpq 18 development headers and shared library,
    pkg-config, a C compiler
NeedsCompilation: yes
